        <mxCell id="O102GTEDFaOgn-5M74sv-103" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="- A sentence is a line of transcription with english text and start time and end time.&lt;div&gt;- User can both listen to audio and read text to trying to mimic audio tone and pronounciation.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- User also can view vietnamese translation to gain understand about context from video&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- User view &quot;Heard&quot; line to see the verdiction of their own pronounciation with score from 0 to 100&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
