        <mxCell id="O102GTEDFaOgn-5M74sv-162" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Translation Modal&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;On recording screen, user click on +Translation modal to open this. Init add video vietnamese transcript is null, must use this modal to add translation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This feature is optional so swap model llm is not implement yet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Left layout = read only english transcript&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Right layout = edit texarea vietnamese transcript&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Copy + Prompt button = Click to copy whole english transcript + prompt to ask chatgpt to translation to vietnamese, ready to paste to chatgpt&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Auto translation = using llm local on server to do the same as Copy + Prompt button&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Verify =&amp;nbsp; precheck data on right layout valid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Save = save vietnamese transcript&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
